  "repositoryControlledGaps": [
    "Sealed kernel-verified local grant, manifest, immutable input and trusted deadline preparation is implemented in local_admission.rs. It is not connected to the synchronous compatibility worker and cannot enter a physical effect. Complete inference.control-owned dispatch proof, attested handle, real artifact descriptors and the async live-cancellation/deadline driver before local production execution.",
    "The experimental semantic profile now persists full operation/result and resource identity through inference.control and has source-level recovery tests. Complete the sealed verified-grant to physical driver handoff, OS-observed resource limits, real local model process and protected Neuron/Agentd consumer; there is no production composition claim.",
    "Implement/prove actual local weights, tokenizer, runtime, device and OS-observed aggregate memory enforcement before claiming isolated inference.",
    "Exact App Server thread-history reconciliation and a redacted no-effect diagnostic snapshot are implemented. Permanent missing-history resolution, authenticated later token-usage amendments, configurable acknowledgement grace and complete durable age/metrics remain open. Unknown usage and transport loss never imply zero usage or safe replay.",
    "Require successful final exact-head and merge-candidate qualification on Linux/macOS. Retained predecessor evidence has inference.control 29/29, Agentd 169/169 and worker 61/62 on a macOS merge candidate; the output repair has not yet been proved by that historical run. Global stale observations and non-ancestor implementation-map anchors remain repository-controlled blockers."
